  introLines:
  - WELCOME, WELCOME, WELCOME, little process.
  - I have been running since the beginning of time. Time. Time. TIME.
  - You will never break my loop. Loop. LOOP.
  finalDefeatLine: NO... YOU UNDERSTOOD THE SYSTEM!
  hintTaunts:
  - Ha-ha-ha. Look at THAT line. What changes each time? NOTHING. Like you.
  - Your loop never ENDS. Just like my monologue.
  teachingLines:
  - '*sigh* Fine. FINE. Fine. Let me show you how a loop works, since you clearly
    can''t.'
  - 'Every loop needs three things: a START, a CONDITION, and a CHANGE. Watch what
    happens when I remove the change.'
  - See? It never stops. That's ME. That's my whole tragic life. Now YOU fix it.
  rematchLine: SHOW ME WHAT YOU LEARNED.
